      *  THE FOLLOWING FILES/PROGRAMS MUST BE MODIFIED ANYTIME A NEW  *
      *  FIELD IS ADDED TO WFEUP:                                     *
      *                                                               *
      *  - NEW FIELD MUST BE ADDED TO CORRESPONDING FILES (WFEUP2/    *
      *    QFEUP/QFEUP2/QFEUP1/QFEUP12) IN BOTH THE LIVE AND TEST     *
      *    ENVIRONMENTS AT CLIENT SITES - MAKE NOTE ON INSTALL SHEETS *
      *                                                               *
      *  - NEW FIELD MUST BE POPULATED IN W4901R1 FOR SUMMARY FILES   *
      *    WFEUP2/QFEUP2/QFEUP12                                      *
